      "id": "bsky:at://did:plc:3pzepjafmdqgrchkqdypeuea/app.bsky.feed.post/3mx7jn54rxf2g",
      "text": "Interim Scotland coach Dave Butcher is remaining focused on the bigger picture despite his team’s seven-match losing streak\nAnd he's confirmed he's held talks over taking the job on a permanent basis\n🔗 shorturl.at/VQoP6",
      "author": "Scotland Rugby News",
