      "id": "bsky:at://did:plc:ouvin3vruox2v2t674dym2c5/app.bsky.feed.post/3mx7iss6gyc25",
      "text": "Great to see Tom Howe being given his debut on Friday night.\nA lot of focus on his size considering he's still only 18, but the big man can shift too!\nGreat effort to get back on this break and make the tackle.",
      "author": "Cardiff Rugby Life",
      "handle": "cardiffrugbylife.bsky.social",
