      "text": "Toyota Cheetahs to make St Helen’s their European home 🐆\nThe South African side will make St Helen’s their European home for the 2026/27 EPCR Challenge Cup pool stage, facing Welsh side Dragons and French Top 14 outfit USAP.\n(1/2) 🧵",
      "author": "Ospreys Rugby",
      "handle": "ospreysofficial.bsky.social",
