      "text": "Great to see Teddy Williams deservedly on the scoresheet and a good finish too, but particularly want to highlight that Alex Mann assist.\nSo late and so well disguised, his link play is consistently top class.",
      "author": "Cardiff Rugby Life",
      "handle": "cardiffrugbylife.bsky.social",
      "avatar": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:ouvin3vruox2v2t674dym2c5/bafkreifwhig3c235gkfloyju2rzwylbbjo3sp6xo57fhnk2ib7ywn7i37i",
      "url": "https://bsky.app/profile/cardiffrugbylife.bsky.social/post/3mx5bax3pic2a",
      "publishedAt": "2026-10-05T15:47:48.843Z",
      "thumbnail": "https://video.bsky.app/watch/did%3Aplc%3Aouvin3vruox2v2t674dym2c5/bafkreibgwwccl56fc4gwwne6tprfsuseuleojw7wtojtoahrctf532hgju/thumbnail.jpg",
