      "text": "As we get ready to take on Cardiff at Laya Arena this Saturday, let's look back on our first game at the RDS 21 years ago 🏉\nHow many players can you name from the Leinster team who beat Cardiff that fateful October day in 2005? 🤔\nTry the quiz here 👉 https://bit.ly/4y4B8KB",
      "author": "Leinster Rugby",
      "handle": "leinsterrugby.bsky.social",
      "avatar": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:bgeqymeltxrtny34aikxe4vy/bafkreidewh6iscgzmp56acshzhwoixyjoxxld6vj6bi76zvuyirnaqf66y",
